@startuml
title Report Content And Admin Review Sequence Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User" as User
participant "Angular Feed/Profile UI" as Frontend
participant "Security Filter" as Security
participant "ReportController" as ReportController
participant "ReportService" as ReportService
participant "ReportRepository" as ReportRepository
database "MySQL" as MySQL
actor "Admin / Moderator" as Moderator
participant "Angular Admin Reports Page" as AdminUi
participant "AdminReportController" as AdminController
participant "AdminReportService" as AdminService
participant "ModerationAuditLogRepository" as AuditRepository
participant "PostRepository / CommentRepository / MediaRepository" as TargetRepositories

== Submit Report ==

User -> Frontend: Select report action
Frontend --> User: Show report form
User -> Frontend: Submit reason and details
Frontend -> Security: POST /reports
Security -> Security: Validate Bearer JWT

alt Token invalid or expired
  Security --> Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
  Frontend --> User: Redirect to login
else Token valid
  Security -> ReportController: Authenticated report request
  ReportController -> ReportService: createReport(request, currentUser)
  ReportService -> ReportService: Validate targetType, targetId, reason
  ReportService -> ReportRepository: Check duplicate open report
  ReportRepository -> MySQL: Query reports
  MySQL --> ReportRepository: Duplicate or empty

  alt Duplicate open report exists
    ReportService --> ReportController: BusinessRuleException
    ReportController --> Frontend: 409 Conflict
    Frontend --> User: Show already reported message
  else No duplicate report
    ReportService -> ReportRepository: save(OPEN report)
    ReportRepository -> MySQL: Insert reports row
    MySQL --> ReportRepository: Report saved
    ReportService --> ReportController: Report response
    ReportController --> Frontend: 201 Created
    Frontend --> User: Show report submitted
  end
end

== Admin Review ==

Moderator -> AdminUi: Open admin reports page
AdminUi -> Security: GET /admin/reports
Security -> AdminController: Authenticated admin request
AdminController -> AdminService: getReports(filters, pageable)
AdminService -> ReportRepository: Load reports
ReportRepository -> MySQL: Query reports
MySQL --> ReportRepository: Report page
AdminService --> AdminController: Report page
AdminController --> AdminUi: 200 OK
AdminUi --> Moderator: Display moderation queue

Moderator -> AdminUi: Resolve or moderate target
AdminUi -> Security: POST /admin/reports/{id}/resolve or moderation action
Security -> AdminController: Authenticated admin action
AdminController -> AdminService: resolveReport/moderateTarget(...)
AdminService -> ReportRepository: Update status, resolver, note
ReportRepository -> MySQL: Update reports row
AdminService -> TargetRepositories: Hide/delete/restore target when requested
TargetRepositories -> MySQL: Update target status
AdminService -> AuditRepository: save audit log
AuditRepository -> MySQL: Insert moderation_audit_logs row
AdminService --> AdminController: Updated report/action response
AdminController --> AdminUi: 200 OK
AdminUi --> Moderator: Update report status

@enduml
